From 2a7b20b9b2778bf2f67211e5ccdbca1845841f70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Schuff <dschuff@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 30 Jan 2026 00:55:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/30] pairlocalalign: Use a temporary file to buffer input

  The main function in pairlocalalign.c followed this sequence when no input file was specified:
   1. It assigned infp = stdin.
   2. It called getnumlen(infp), which reads the entire stream to count how many sequences are present.
   3. It called rewind(infp), intending to reset the stream to the beginning.
   4. It called readData(infp, ...), expecting to read the sequence data from the start.

  Because rewind() has no effect on a standard input stream, the second read (readData) immediately hit EOF.
  Consequently, the program thought it had successfully read 100 sequences, but every sequence string was actually empty.

  * Expected Behavior: The program should perform $N \times (N-1) / 2$ pairwise alignments.
    For the provided 100-sequence test file, this produces thousands of lines of alignment scores and progress updates
    (e.g.,     0 / 100,     1 / 100) followed by a summary of the alignment results.
  * Emscripten Failure: Because the sequences were empty, the alignment loops were either skipped or performed trivial work.
    The output consisted only of the initialization headers and the final version/exit messages, missing all the actual scientific data.

  Instead of reading directly from stdin, the program now:
   1. Buffers the entire contents of stdin into a temporary file (tmpfile()).
   2. Uses that temporary file (which does support rewind()) for all subsequent processing.

  This ensures the sequence data is available for both the counting and reading phases, allowing the test
  to produce the complete output that matches the reference MD5 hash (46e32283ed5b62ce87637ef6b6bfa115).
---
 MultiSource/Benchmarks/mafft/pairlocalalign.c | 13 ++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/MultiSource/Benchmarks/mafft/pairlocalalign.c b/MultiSource/Benchmarks/mafft/pairlocalalign.c
index 7c5c5afd4..04954033a 100644
--- a/MultiSource/Benchmarks/mafft/pairlocalalign.c
+++ b/MultiSource/Benchmarks/mafft/pairlocalalign.c
@@ -1164,7 +1164,18 @@ int main( int argc, char *argv[] )
 		}
 	}
 	else
-		infp = stdin;
+	{
+		infp = tmpfile();
+		if( !infp )
+		{
+			fprintf( stderr, "Cannot open temporary file\n" );
+			exit( 1 );
+		}
+		int c;
+		while( ( c = getc( stdin ) ) != EOF )
+			putc( c, infp );
+		rewind( infp );
+	}
 
 	getnumlen( infp );
 	rewind( infp );
